00:52:19,898 --> 00:52:25,349
Answer: add changes ko staging area mein
le jaata hai, yaani chunna ki kya jaayega.

860
00:52:25,569 --> 00:52:30,927
Commit staged snapshot ko local
history mein message ke saath save karta hai.

861
00:52:31,147 --> 00:52:34,925
Aur push commits ko remote
par bhejta hai, jaise GitHub.

862
00:52:35,145 --> 00:52:38,209
Trap: sochna ki commit
se kaam upload ho gaya.

863
00:52:38,429 --> 00:52:41,261
Push ke bina woh
sirf aapke laptop par hai.

864
00:52:41,611 --> 00:52:45,005
Teesra: aapne API key
commit karke push kar di.

865
00:52:45,225 --> 00:52:46,628
Ab kya karoge?

866
00:52:48,978 --> 00:52:53,006
Answer: sabse pehle key
turant revoke karo aur nayi banao.

867
00:52:53,226 --> 00:52:58,470
Phir file hatao, gitignore mein jodo,
aur zaroorat ho toh history saaf karo.

868
00:52:58,690 --> 00:53:02,737
Revoke pehle, kyunki key ko
chori hui maan kar chalna chahiye.

869
00:53:02,957 --> 00:53:06,413
Trap: bolna ki agle
commit mein file delete kar di.

870
00:53:06,633 --> 00:53:08,539
Key history mein abhi bhi hai.

871
00:53:08,889 --> 00:53:11,512
Aur chautha: merge conflict kya hota hai?

872
00:53:13,862 --> 00:53:19,611
Answer: jab do branches same lines ko
alag alag tareeke se badalti hain, Git khud

873
00:53:19,611 --> 00:53:21,172
decide nahi kar sakta.

874
00:53:21,392 --> 00:53:24,478
Woh file mein dono
versions mark kar deta hai.

875
00:53:24,698 --> 00:53:29,169
Aap file ko sahi result tak
edit karte ho, phir add aur commit.

876
00:53:29,389 --> 00:53:33,649
Trap: ghabra jaana, ya sab
delete karke dobara clone karna.

877
00:53:33,869 --> 00:53:35,511
Conflict normal hai.

878
00:53:36,811 --> 00:53:38,068
Practice time.

879
00:53:38,288 --> 00:53:40,412
Pause karo aur khud try karo.

880
00:53:40,762 --> 00:53:46,460
Pehla: kaunsi command dikhati hai ki ek
file mein kya badla, jo abhi stage nahi hui?

881
00:53:46,810 --> 00:53:52,288
Doosra: add greeting branch banao, greet
function badlo, commit karo, aur main mein

882
00:53:52,288 --> 00:53:53,014
merge karo.

883
00:53:53,364 --> 00:53:57,224
Teesra: galti se git add
secrets dot txt chala diya.

884
00:53:57,444 --> 00:53:59,207
Usse unstage karo.

885
00:53:59,427 --> 00:54:01,709
Hint: git restore dash dash staged.

886
00:54:02,059 --> 00:54:05,659
Aur scenario: do teammates
ne README ki same line badli.

887
00:54:05,879 --> 00:54:08,940
Git pull par kya hoga, step by step batao.

888
00:54:16,240 --> 00:54:18,399
Aur aapka extension challenge.

889
00:54:18,619 --> 00:54:24,178
Ek ya zyaada chuno, aur har ek ko
apne asli GitHub repository par push karo.

890
00:54:24,528 --> 00:54:29,098
Setup checker mein saatvan check
jodo: kya koi uncommitted changes hain?

891
00:54:29,318 --> 00:54:31,841
Hint: git status dash dash porcelain.

892
00:54:32,191 --> 00:54:36,440
Ek dash dash quiet flag
jodo, jo sirf failures print kare.

893
00:54:36,790 --> 00:54:39,327
Apna GitHub profile README banao.

894
00:54:39,547 --> 00:54:44,314
Yeh ek repository hoti hai
jiska naam aapka username hota hai.

895
00:54:44,664 --> 00:54:49,521
Ya SSH key set up karo, aur
git at github URL se push karo.

896
00:54:50,821 --> 00:54:51,750
Quick check.

897
00:54:51,970 --> 00:54:53,946
Aapne app dot py edit ki.

898
00:54:54,166 --> 00:54:58,249
GitHub tak pahunchane ke liye
commands ka sahi order kya hai?

899
00:55:03,949 --> 00:55:04,504
C.

900
00:55:04,724 --> 00:55:06,993
Pehle add, phir commit, phir push.

901
00:55:07,213 --> 00:55:09,197
Pack karo, seal karo, bhejo.

902
00:55:10,497 --> 00:55:11,943
Doosra question.

903
00:55:12,163 --> 00:55:14,233
Dot env gitignore mein hai.

904
00:55:14,453 --> 00:55:17,464
Git status uske baare mein kya dikhayega?

905
00:55:23,164 --> 00:55:24,388
C, kuch nahi.

906
00:55:24,608 --> 00:55:27,215
Ignored files status mein dikhti hi nahi.

907
00:55:27,435 --> 00:55:31,052
Kyun ignored hai, yeh git
check ignore dash v batata hai.

908
00:55:32,352 --> 00:55:33,261
Teesra.

909
00:55:33,481 --> 00:55:35,623
Teammate ne naye commits push kiye.

910
00:55:35,843 --> 00:55:38,664
Aapke local main mein
kaunsi command laayegi?

911
00:55:44,364 --> 00:55:45,594
B, git pull.

912
00:55:45,814 --> 00:55:49,681
Clone sirf pehli baar
repository lene ke liye hota hai.

913
00:55:50,981 --> 00:55:57,019
Yeh official documentation pages hain:
venv, pip, python dotenv, free Pro Git book,

914
00:55:57,019 --> 00:55:58,546
aur GitHub ki guides.

915
00:55:58,766 --> 00:56:03,355
Links description mein hain, poore
source code aur question bank ke saath.

916
00:56:07,455 --> 00:56:08,295
Recap.

917
00:56:08,515 --> 00:56:10,287
Commit ek save point hai.

918
00:56:10,507 --> 00:56:12,720
Git tool hai, GitHub website.

919
00:56:13,070 --> 00:56:17,009
Status, add, commit, log,
diff, aur restore: roz ki commands.

920
00:56:17,359 --> 00:56:22,147
Pehle commit se pehle
gitignore, dot env aur dot venv ke saath.

921
00:56:22,497 --> 00:56:24,811
Naya kaam branch par, phir merge.

922
00:56:25,161 --> 00:56:27,578
Aur remote ke saath: push, clone, pull.

923
00:56:27,798 --> 00:56:30,725
Roz ka mantra: pull,
kaam, add, commit, push.

924
00:56:32,025 --> 00:56:33,896
Module zero complete!

925
00:56:34,116 --> 00:56:40,380
Aapke paas ab ek terminal hai jise aap
samajhte ho, har project ka apna environment,

926
00:56:40,380 --> 00:56:45,451
secrets code se bahar, aur aapka
pehla repository, history ke saath.

927
00:56:45,671 --> 00:56:51,580
Agle Module mein hum woh Python
seekhenge jo AI agents banane ke liye chahiye.

928
00:56:51,800 --> 00:56:53,901
Milte hain Module one mein.
